      "headingRaw": "Five-character-regular-verseZuYongLOOKINGTOWARDANINNERGATEOFTHEGREATWALL",
      "translationRaw": "MyheartsankwhenIheadednorthfromYanCountryTothecampsofChinaechoingithbugleanddrum。。。。Inanendlesscoldlightofmassivesnow，Tallflagsonthreebordersriseuplikeadawn。War-torchesinvadethebarbarianmoonlight，Mountain-cloudslikechairmenbeartheGreatWallfromthesea。。。。Thoughnoyouthfulclerkmeanttobeagreatgeneral，Ithrowasidemywriting-brush--Likethestudentwhotossedoffcapforalariat，Ichallengewhatmaycome。",
